ow it has the  highest rate of infection in Southeast  Dasia suffering more than a thousand new  cases a day this week mostly among  migrant workers making the city a  cautionary tale and a lesson in what can  happen when vulnerable members of the  population are overlooked the V Gopala  and al Jazeera Hong Kong
 

